 "summary": "No existing declaration in Mathlib, TauCeti, Physlib/PhyslibAlpha/QuantumInfo or EpsilonEridani covers the quadrupole, the 2n-point Wilson-line correlator, or the normalised-trace bound, and the PR reuses located API throughout (norm_trace_le_card_of_mem_unitaryGroup, RCLike.abs_re_le_norm, trace_mul_comm, Unitary.{mul_star_self,star_mul_self}_of_mem, Physlib's trace_unitary_conj), deriving quadrupoleS_self_right/_outer and abs_quadrupoleS_le_one from earlier lemmas instead of reproving them. The one borderline item, Matrix.re_trace_conjTranspose (a composition of Mathlib's trace_conjTranspose with RCLike.conj_re), has two genuine call sites and also deduplicates the inlined argument the dipole bound previously carried.",
